  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Green Financing for Climate Resilient and Low Emission Smallholder Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed programme aims to address one of the biggest barriers for farmers in Niger to implement low-emission and climate-resilient agriculture, which is access to credit. The programme will provide green lines of credit for smallholder farmers, famers&#x2019; organizations (FOs), cooperatives, and micro-, small- and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs) to support adaptation and mitigation activities in their agricultural systems in 186 provinces across four vulnerable regions of Niger.</narrative>
  </description>
